#: ../../source/powerpoint_pptxgenjs.md:366
msgid "Common Pitfalls"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/powerpoint_pptxgenjs.md:368
msgid ""
"⚠️ These issues cause file corruption, visual bugs, or broken output. "
"Avoid them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/powerpoint_pptxgenjs.md:370
msgid "**NEVER use \"#\" with hex colors** - causes file corruption"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/powerpoint_pptxgenjs.md:376
msgid ""
"**NEVER encode opacity in hex color strings** - 8-char colors (e.g., "
"`\"00000020\"`) corrupt the file. Use the `opacity` property instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/powerpoint_pptxgenjs.md:382
msgid ""
"**Use `bullet: true`** - NEVER unicode symbols like \"•\" (creates double"
" bullets)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/powerpoint_pptxgenjs.md:384
msgid "**Use `breakLine: true`** between array items or text runs together"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/powerpoint_pptxgenjs.md:386
msgid ""
"**Avoid `lineSpacing` with bullets** - causes excessive gaps; use "
"`paraSpaceAfter` instead"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/powerpoint_pptxgenjs.md:388
msgid ""
"**Each presentation needs fresh instance** - don't reuse `pptxgen()` "
"objects"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/powerpoint_pptxgenjs.md:390
msgid ""
"**NEVER reuse option objects across calls** - PptxGenJS mutates objects "
"in-place (e.g. converting shadow values to EMU). Sharing one object "
"between multiple calls corrupts the second shape."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/powerpoint_pptxgenjs.md:401
msgid ""
"**Don't use `ROUNDED_RECTANGLE` with accent borders** - rectangular "
"overlay bars won't cover rounded corners. Use `RECTANGLE` instead."
msgstr ""

